eirah Beach, offering Four Seasons Private Residences Jumeirah rent options for those seeking unparalleled luxury.As the city's most prestigious address, the standalone Four Seasons Private Residences at Jumeirah encompasses an exclusive collection of 28 residences, penthouses, and villas, all overlooking the Dubai Water Canal. Each element, from the detailed marble inlays to the hand-selected art installations in the lobby, has been thoughtfully curated to meet the expectations of those who seek nothing but the best.","price":19000000,"title":"Four Seasons Private Residences Jumeirah","bitrix":{"id":377,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Four Season Private Residences Jumeirah","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Four Season Private Residences Jumeirah","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"H&H Development","project_location":"Jumeirah"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/private_residence_jumeirah_feat_34d80b5091.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/private_residence_jumeirah_feat_34d80b5091.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.202188,"lng":55.239519},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/private_residence_jumeirah_1_4bf0139ad8.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/private_residence_jumeirah_1_4bf0139ad8.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/private_residence_jumeirah_2_b35a2616b5.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/private_residence_jumeirah_2_b35a2616b5.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/private_residence_jumeirah_3_b64b99348d.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/private_residence_jumeirah_3_b64b99348d.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/private_residence_jumeirah_feat_34d80b5091.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/p